  "engine": "PostgreSQL 16 Alpine Docker integration fixture",
  "contract": [
    "Two schemas define state enums with the same name but different labels; the target enum includes a target-only label that the shadow enum rejects.",
    "The pool role defaults search_path to the shadow schema. CSV exports and re-imports the target schema rows using a collision-free NULL marker; values include target-only text, empty text, literal NULL and SQL NULL.",
    "The insert plan casts the text parameter to the schema-qualified destination enum. pg_typeof and exact UTF-8 bytes confirm the persisted target type and labels.",
    "The pre-existing destination sibling remains unchanged and the same-named shadow table remains empty."
